WEBVTT

00:01:42.770 --> 00:01:45.010
I'm tired.

00:01:46.710 --> 00:01:47.760
It's only a little further.

00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:49.620
I'm tired.

00:01:52.240 --> 00:01:53.140
Bang!

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:01.600
Who're you?

00:02:05.870 --> 00:02:06.640
Yay!

00:02:08.050 --> 00:02:09.410
It's Miki-chan!

00:02:10.670 --> 00:02:12.060
You know her, Yuzuyu?

00:02:13.470 --> 00:02:15.860
Long time no see, Yuzuyu!

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:23.050
You look well.

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:24.730
Yep!

00:02:25.600 --> 00:02:27.700
Hey, hey! Who is she to you?

00:02:28.190 --> 00:02:28.830
Who're you?

00:02:29.530 --> 00:02:30.230
You sure are noisy!

00:02:30.690 --> 00:02:31.880
I'm Sakashita Miki!

00:02:32.190 --> 00:02:33.170
I'm Yuzuyu's cousin.

00:02:35.910 --> 00:02:38.830
I... came to pick you up!

00:02:59.930 --> 00:03:01.860
I'll take Yuzuyu to my place now.

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:04.630
Hey! What're you talking about?

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:09.230
Yuzuyu, get away from her.

00:03:12.360 --> 00:03:13.100
Don't come any closer.

00:03:14.570 --> 00:03:15.430
What're you doing!?

00:03:15.610 --> 00:03:16.610
Calm down!

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:18.810
I am calm.

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:20.100
Miki-chan?

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:25.530
Umm... Well...

00:03:27.460 --> 00:03:29.180
Yuzuyu! Come here!

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:30.820
What?

00:03:37.760 --> 00:03:39.360
What? You're scared by this little thing?

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:40.560
It was a joke.

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:49.440
Well, whatever.

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:52.580
Let's chat.

00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:10.600
Mr. Bear, Mr. Bear. Let's eat!

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:15.750
Let's take a bath before that, Mr. Bunny.

00:04:27.480 --> 00:04:28.200
What's your name?

00:04:29.230 --> 00:04:30.080
I'm Sakashita Miki.

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:31.750
How old are you?

00:04:32.610 --> 00:04:33.380
Fourteen.

00:04:34.270 --> 00:04:35.590
Fourteen!?

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:39.970
Are you nuts? What's with that outfit?

00:04:40.990 --> 00:04:41.960
Don't call me dumb.

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:43.060
Damn it!

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:46.000
I can't deal with such young, healthy skin!

00:04:46.010 --> 00:04:48.160
Sis! That's not the point!

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:57.580
So let me see if I understand how you're related to us.

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:05.730
Our mother's sister's husband's sibling's daughter?

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:08.150
You're just an outsider.

00:05:09.480 --> 00:05:10.460
She sure is...

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:11.460
Umm...

00:05:11.940 --> 00:05:12.750
Miki-chan

00:05:14.730 --> 00:05:17.480
Do your mother and father have the same opinion?

00:05:18.200 --> 00:05:19.960
Did they ask you to come here?

00:05:20.510 --> 00:05:21.450
Of course!

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:24.150
I'm here representing the Sakashita family.

00:05:24.530 --> 00:05:27.340
Don't speak casually to my mother!

00:05:29.080 --> 00:05:31.310
Kippei saying that is...

00:05:33.250 --> 00:05:36.390
Why are you appearing so suddenly over something so important?

00:05:37.210 --> 00:05:41.820
It's not like we're gonna say, "Sure, take her," and hand Yuzuyu-chan over just like that.

00:05:42.680 --> 00:05:44.760
What the hell, you little shrimp!?

00:05:44.760 --> 00:05:45.390
Hey!

00:05:45.560 --> 00:05:49.090
Her way of speaking and her attitude are totally wrong.

00:05:49.810 --> 00:05:50.500
What?

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:52.730
Oh, jeez. Just cut it out! Shush!

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:58.940
For us, Yuzuyu is a necessity.

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:07.210
I'm not leaving 'til you hand Yuzuyu over.

00:06:08.190 --> 00:06:09.570
In other words, let me stay.

00:06:11.540 --> 00:06:14.120
How can you get by being so arrogant?

00:06:17.340 --> 00:06:19.090
It can't be helped, Mom... prepare a room for her.

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:23.260
Sis... are you serious?

00:06:23.390 --> 00:06:24.500
Yes, I am.

00:06:31.930 --> 00:06:33.530
It's already time to change.

00:06:42.820 --> 00:06:44.000
Hey, Sis!

00:06:46.110 --> 00:06:47.800
That girl is dangerous, I'm telling you!

00:06:48.120 --> 00:06:48.530
Yeah...

00:06:49.120 --> 00:06:50.590
She does seem rather dangerous.

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:55.570
She has that dangerous thing in her pocket, too.

00:06:56.170 --> 00:06:57.140
Oh, well...

00:06:57.840 --> 00:06:59.530
You can't just say, "Oh, well..."!

00:06:59.670 --> 00:07:01.430
Are you thinking straight?

00:07:01.430 --> 00:07:02.860
It can't be helped!

00:07:03.010 --> 00:07:05.450
This is a matter involving Yuzuyu.

00:07:07.590 --> 00:07:11.530
If they're really serious about taking care of her... then we've got to talk about it.

00:07:16.020 --> 00:07:19.960
We have no right to keep her here all to ourselves.

00:07:25.860 --> 00:07:28.830
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:37.140
I... don't want to juggle Yuzuyu around.

00:07:41.250 --> 00:07:43.470
Yes, well, that's true...

00:07:44.590 --> 00:07:45.980
Well, it'll work out somehow.

00:07:46.680 --> 00:07:49.250
Dont' pat me!

00:07:49.970 --> 00:07:51.210
It's okay

00:07:51.640 --> 00:07:54.090
We won't hand her over that easily.

00:07:54.650 --> 00:07:58.220
Moreover, don't you find it strange that the brat came all by herself?

00:08:02.260 --> 00:08:05.220
Until this is resolved, you'll protect Yuzuyu-chan from her.

00:08:05.490 --> 00:08:07.700
Isn't it nice that it's vacation?

00:08:08.860 --> 00:08:11.950
You can stay with Yuzuyu-chan!

00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:14.890
Hey!

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:25.320
This is such a pain...

00:08:39.060 --> 00:08:41.120
Are you that scared of me?

00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:44.030
.... 'Cause you don't know what I'll do to Yuzuyu.

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:48.060
Don't wave dangerous things around in the house.

00:08:49.320 --> 00:08:50.310
You talking about this?

00:08:50.950 --> 00:08:51.840
I just told you...!

00:08:54.120 --> 00:08:54.740
Well, are you scared?

00:08:55.950 --> 00:08:57.250
I'm gonna throw you out!

00:08:59.670 --> 00:09:02.590
It's just a normal keychain.

00:09:06.260 --> 00:09:09.550
Although it can't hurt anyone... it scares wusses like you.

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:16.330
I'm taking Yuzuyu, no matter what.

00:09:18.060 --> 00:09:18.740
I won't hand her over.

00:09:32.530 --> 00:09:33.630
I'll lock the door.

00:09:34.410 --> 00:09:36.030
Are you done talking?

00:09:36.540 --> 00:09:38.520
Yeah, for today.

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:40.680
Did Miki-chan go home?

00:09:41.710 --> 00:09:42.970
She' staying here.

00:09:44.470 --> 00:09:45.380
Really?

00:09:48.390 --> 00:09:52.620
Am I really going to go to her house?

00:09:55.050 --> 00:10:01.360
If I have to go... you'll come with me, right?

00:10:04.280 --> 00:10:05.450
I can't go.

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:16.800
I like Miki-chan, but... I don't wanna leave you!

00:10:20.350 --> 00:10:21.590
What're you saying?

00:10:22.250 --> 00:10:24.550
We won't be separated, so don't cry.

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:26.570
Really?

00:10:27.670 --> 00:10:28.110
Yeah.

00:10:28.420 --> 00:10:29.370
It'll be okay.

00:10:58.200 --> 00:11:00.090
Kippei? What's wrong?

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:01.640
You seem tired.

00:11:03.310 --> 00:11:05.060
Kokoro-chin, listen!

00:11:05.460 --> 00:11:07.680
There's this strange girl at my house.

00:11:08.090 --> 00:11:10.270
She's talking about taking Yuzuyu away.

00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:12.750
It's terrible!

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:15.860
Is that strange girl...

00:11:20.730 --> 00:11:21.630
...Miki?

00:11:33.030 --> 00:11:33.670
It was a dream.

00:11:38.690 --> 00:11:39.730
You were having a nightmare.

00:11:42.490 --> 00:11:45.180
Huh? What're you doing?

00:11:45.670 --> 00:11:47.560
I thought I locked the door.

00:11:48.840 --> 00:11:50.230
Seriously...

00:11:53.120 --> 00:11:54.580
What're you doing?

00:11:55.760 --> 00:11:56.690
She came in on her own!

00:11:57.500 --> 00:11:59.400
You can't come in, Miki-chan!

00:12:00.040 --> 00:12:00.870
What?

00:12:02.680 --> 00:12:04.970
I felt like he hated me, so... I planned to show him some love.

00:12:05.390 --> 00:12:06.240
I don't need any!

00:12:07.690 --> 00:12:11.610
You know, Kippei-onii-chan has Kokoro-onee-chan!

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:12.920
Yuzuyu, dont say that!

00:12:13.570 --> 00:12:15.200
What? You have a girl?

00:12:16.410 --> 00:12:17.500
Let me meet her.

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:19.890
I won't!

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:21.260
Get out!

00:12:36.720 --> 00:12:38.110
I feel outta it...

00:12:38.630 --> 00:12:39.320
Yeah...

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:44.070
Satsuki... You spoke well yesterday.

00:12:44.630 --> 00:12:45.660
From now on...

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:48.260
I never want to talk to her again.

00:13:28.350 --> 00:13:29.120
Miki-chan!

00:13:32.090 --> 00:13:34.130
Wanna play with me?

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:40.360
I'm not going to play in the sand.

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:44.270
Boo!

00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:47.810
But you did before!

00:13:53.970 --> 00:13:56.960
You've changed.

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:00.360
What?

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:02.730
Are you saying you don't like me now?

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:04.440
No.

00:14:05.330 --> 00:14:06.980
You've grown up!

00:14:07.250 --> 00:14:08.930
You've become cuter!

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:11.590
And also...

00:14:28.690 --> 00:14:29.330
Yuzuyu...

00:14:40.430 --> 00:14:40.980
Yuzuyu.

00:14:45.290 --> 00:14:46.720
Come here.

00:15:12.880 --> 00:15:14.050
I'm coming!

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:15.480
MIKI!!

00:15:20.340 --> 00:15:21.020
Miki!

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:24.170
Dad's appeared.

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:25.100
"Dad"?

00:15:25.600 --> 00:15:27.070
So Sis called them...

00:15:27.760 --> 00:15:28.570
I heard about it!

00:15:29.100 --> 00:15:32.580
You said we'd take care of Noriaki's kid!

00:15:32.980 --> 00:15:34.410
What the hell were you thinking?!

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:35.410
That hurts!

00:15:36.110 --> 00:15:38.520
You dare to come here on your own and do as you please?!

00:15:40.150 --> 00:15:42.490
You're a disgrace to us!

00:15:43.150 --> 00:15:47.060
Just shut up and stay at home doing nothing!

00:15:47.260 --> 00:15:47.760
Hey!

00:15:52.370 --> 00:15:54.230
Uncle! You don't need to hit her!

00:15:55.900 --> 00:15:56.330
Hey!

00:15:56.970 --> 00:15:58.200
Don't wave that around inside the house!

00:16:06.910 --> 00:16:07.800
Yuzuyu-chan, come here!

00:16:15.190 --> 00:16:15.690
Hey!

00:16:19.590 --> 00:16:21.390
What's with you?

00:16:22.190 --> 00:16:23.750
Don't act like that in my house!

00:16:24.350 --> 00:16:26.840
Sorry about this...

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:29.930
My daughter was acting like that, and I suddenly...

00:16:29.930 --> 00:16:31.270
Dear, you've just...

00:16:31.570 --> 00:16:34.010
Hey! What're you doing?

00:16:34.310 --> 00:16:35.910
I heard a loud voice from outside!

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:38.560
I'll go catch her.

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:33.730
Hey.

00:17:36.870 --> 00:17:41.170
I thought i told you not to wave that around the house.

00:17:42.110 --> 00:17:44.680
I didn't wave it around... I dropped it.

00:17:54.150 --> 00:17:55.020
Is that it?

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:57.690
Running away from home 'cause you hate your dad?

00:17:58.290 --> 00:17:58.920
Puberty?

00:18:02.060 --> 00:18:04.860
You didn't come to take Yuzuyu.

00:18:07.400 --> 00:18:09.370
Yes, I ran away from home.

00:18:27.150 --> 00:18:29.050
This is...

00:18:29.050 --> 00:18:33.010
You've noticed... my will power.

00:18:40.100 --> 00:18:42.330
What're you doing? You're a girl.

00:18:45.700 --> 00:18:46.610
Let me go!

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:54.010
That was to protect me...

00:18:55.450 --> 00:18:58.820
These burns are something for me to show off...

00:19:03.440 --> 00:19:08.950
I wanted to try hurting someone once...

00:19:15.170 --> 00:19:17.240
You're a disgrace to us!

00:19:26.420 --> 00:19:27.670
It's summer vacation...

00:19:32.260 --> 00:19:35.000
Before it's over, you'll want to return home.

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:42.590
As such... I'm confiscating that!

00:19:52.190 --> 00:19:53.720
You two!

00:19:54.540 --> 00:19:55.440
Yuzuyu!

00:19:56.240 --> 00:19:57.570
You came here on your own?

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:01.450
What if you had gotten lost?

00:20:07.920 --> 00:20:10.290
Miki-chan, are you okay?

00:20:10.750 --> 00:20:14.390
Your parents made Onee-sama mad!

00:20:16.130 --> 00:20:18.060
They went home!

00:20:19.230 --> 00:20:19.780
Seriously?

00:20:20.830 --> 00:20:22.550
Sis is amazing.

00:20:30.920 --> 00:20:34.530
I'm gonna go buy some ice cream for you kids.

00:20:35.590 --> 00:20:36.910
Are you talking about me?

00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:40.150
I want milk flavour!

00:20:41.850 --> 00:20:42.390
Are you sure?

00:20:44.470 --> 00:20:46.640
About leaving us alone together...

00:20:49.160 --> 00:20:55.030
I won't say that I won't do anything to her.

00:20:56.630 --> 00:21:00.730
I can't help it... Yuzuyu likes you.

00:21:03.560 --> 00:21:04.060
Yep!

00:21:06.610 --> 00:21:07.340
What's with that?

00:21:14.440 --> 00:21:16.870
Before it's over, you'll want to return home.

00:23:28.890 --> 00:23:33.410
If I had run away from home over something simple like puberty, I'd be happy...

00:23:35.760 --> 00:23:36.190
Huh?

00:23:37.790 --> 00:23:40.630
I never want to go home!

00:23:41.860 --> 00:23:46.570
So they need you to replace me!

00:23:49.890 --> 00:23:51.880
Yuzuyu, I...

00:23:57.760 --> 00:23:58.930
...want to die.

00:24:18.680 --> 00:24:19.780
All right!

00:24:19.780 --> 00:24:22.630
It's summer, so we'll help around the house!

00:24:22.750 --> 00:24:24.870
I like helping out!

00:24:25.130 --> 00:24:26.310
Miki-chan, too!

00:24:26.310 --> 00:24:27.050
You freeloader!

00:24:27.990 --> 00:24:29.010
Here! A broom and dustpan!

00:24:29.010 --> 00:24:29.820
Get to work!

00:24:30.050 --> 00:24:30.900
No slacking!

00:24:31.180 --> 00:24:32.710
Now we'll go on an errand!

00:24:33.020 --> 00:24:35.280
Yay! An errand!

00:24:35.600 --> 00:24:37.100
Miki, hurry up!

00:24:37.850 --> 00:24:39.610
Next time on Aishiteru ze Baby:

00:24:39.900 --> 00:24:41.450
Lets Line Up and Walk!

00:24:41.940 --> 00:24:43.830
Miki-chan, where're you going?

00:24:44.170 --> 00:24:47.470
You'll make Kippei-onii-chan angry!
